# 👋 Hi, I'm Kelvin Mutua Murungi

I am a **Data Scientist, Statistician, and AI Researcher** pursuing a **PhD in Computer Science at the University of Nairobi**, with a background in applied statistics and data analytics.

My work sits at the intersection of **artificial intelligence, machine learning, statistics, and sustainable development**. I am particularly interested in developing practical, data-driven solutions to challenges in **agriculture, food safety, public health, climate resilience, and development**.

My current research focuses on **AI-driven risk prediction, early-warning systems, and decision-support tools**, with an emphasis on applying machine learning and statistical methods to real-world African development challenges.

