## 🚀 Featured Projects

### ⭐ Aflatoxin Early-Warning & Risk Prediction

Developing AI and statistical models for **aflatoxin risk prediction and risk-based surveillance in Kenya**, integrating agricultural, environmental, climatic, health, and surveillance data.

**Focus areas:** Machine Learning · Geospatial Analytics · Climate Data · Risk Modelling · Explainable AI · Early Warning

### 📊 Digital Survey & Data Collection Systems

Developing digital solutions for **survey automation, data collection, quality control, and research data management**.

**Focus areas:** Survey Technology · Data Management · Automation · Research Analytics

### 🧠 Predictive Analytics & Decision Support

Developing statistical and machine-learning models to support **risk assessment, forecasting, business intelligence, and evidence-based decision-making**.

